          "passageId": "ws16d-p14",
          "text": {
            "en": "Imperial Secretariat Gentleman Lian Zhao submitted a memorial accusing Cao Fan, the Imperial Secretariat Left Assistant, of imposing punishments contrary to imperial edicts, and Cao Fan was tried and questioned.",
            "zht": "尚書郎廉昭上奏彈劾尚書左丞曹璠用刑違背詔令，曹璠因此受到審訊。",
            "zhs": "尚书郎廉昭上奏弹劾尚书左丞曹璠用刑违背诏令，曹璠因此受到审讯。"
