      "type": "colleagues",
      "polarity": "negative",
      "directed": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws16d-p14",
          "text": {
            "en": "Lian Zhao's accusation drew in the Director of the Imperial Secretariat, Chen Jiao, who submitted a memorial declaring he dared not evade punishment nor impose heavy penalties.",
            "zht": "廉昭的彈劾牽涉尚書令陳矯，陳矯上奏表示不敢逃避責罰，也不敢加重處罰。",
            "zhs": "廉昭的弹劾牵涉尚书令陈矫，陈矫上奏表示不敢逃避责罚，也不敢加重处罚。"
