      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws16d-p21",
          "text": {
            "en": "A note identifies Sima Tong as King Xuan's fifth younger brother, an aide to the Colonel of the Capital.",
            "zht": "注稱司馬通為宣王司馬懿的五弟，曾任司隸校尉屬官。",
            "zhs": "注称司马通为宣王司马懿的五弟，曾任司隶校尉属官。"
