      "directed": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws16d-p21",
          "text": {
            "en": "Sima Tong's son Sima Shun was enfeoffed as Neighbourhood Marquis of Longyang, but when Jin accepted Wei's abdication he refused to recognise the new mandate and was stripped of his title and exiled to Wuwei.",
            "zht": "司馬通之子司馬順封隆陽亭侯，晉受魏禪時他拒不承認天命，被削爵流放武威。",
            "zhs": "司马通之子司马顺封隆阳亭侯，晋受魏禅时他拒不承认天命，被削爵流放武威。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
