          "passageId": "ws16d-p25",
          "text": {
            "en": "Du Shu replied to Song Quan in a letter explaining that he acted on his own convictions and would bear the consequences himself, whether or not Cheng Xi understood.",
            "zht": "杜恕致書宋權，說明自己依己見行事，無論程喜是否理解，後果皆由自己承擔。",
            "zhs": "杜恕致书宋权，说明自己依己见行事，无论程喜是否理解，后果皆由自己承担。"
