      "type": "personal",
      "polarity": "positive",
      "directed": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws16d-p26",
          "text": {
            "en": "When both were recalled and stood before the Commandant of Justice, Ruan Wu counselled Du Shu that he had talent but lacked firmness and singleness of purpose, and urged him to use his leisure to set forth a teaching of his own; Du Shu then wrote the Discourse on Fundamentals in exile.",
            "zht": "二人同被召至廷尉，阮武勸告杜恕有才而少堅定、專一，請他利用閒暇著書立說；杜恕在流放期間遂作《體論》。",
            "zhs": "二人同被召至廷尉，阮武劝告杜恕有才而少坚定、专一，请他利用闲暇著书立说；杜恕在流放期间遂作《体论》。"
          }
        }
